{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16mini_level_act16mini_st01","groupId":"act16mini","stageId":null,"title":"蓋不住的鍋蓋","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16mini/level_act16mini_st01.txt","sourceHash":"e7ba4a546d60c4122b8aa3f84fd7dc3d09f0d5d322337e55c0b51258c73c1b36","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"運載車即將開始最後一趟行程，溫米配合司機阿蘭娜為交車做準備，心中卻十分不捨，希望所有事情都不順利，以此延緩交車時間。彷彿是回應她的期待，一名奇怪的乘客持弩劫車，要求前往咧嘴谷。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"熱騰騰的鍋子裡，菜湯咕嘟咕嘟冒泡的聲音，很好聽。\n爸爸收音機裡的雪花聲，磨刀爺爺的吆喝聲，身邊這個動力爐的機械運轉聲……雖然它們也很好聽，但是我聽不到了，或者……很快就要聽不到了。\n火苗燃燒著，是在提醒我，要開心一點，再開心一點……就像爸爸期待的那樣。\n好像火候不太夠啊，加一點火力吧，呼——\n嗯？這個聲音是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐！你怎麼又在敲碗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前不是說過了嗎，不要敲碗啊！吵到別人怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敲就敲了，在我的車上我還不能做主喔？車站裡本來就鬧哄哄的，能吵到人才怪哩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無聊嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妳今天莫名其妙煮了這麼多菜，害我等這麼老半天，肚子都要餓扁了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了防止這些菜一下子冷掉，我當然需要弄點動靜來提醒它們——慢點變涼，慢點變涼，還要等著小鍋蓋一起吃呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是藉口……真是的，蘭娜姐總是不把事情放在心上，像個任性的小孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真覺得無聊，妳還不如來廚房幫幫我咧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，畢竟你才是“六星級大廚”嘛。小鍋蓋真的很厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能不要叫我小鍋蓋啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這個紅紅的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這個是番茄燴瘤獸肉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛煮好的喔，一定超級好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"番茄燴瘤獸肉？怎麼是這個顏色的？湯汁不是應該更黃一點嗎——"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音未落，阿蘭娜的湯匙已經伸進了熱騰騰的菜碗裡，把一大塊瘤獸肉塞進嘴中。\n雖然舌頭被燙得打轉，但阿蘭娜還是伸出大拇指比個了讚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔……嘶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好吃耶！不愧是我們運載車上的“六星級大廚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這次蘭娜姐帶回來的肉格外新鮮，所以不用太多調味也香香的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？看來菜市場老闆知道我們要走，特地給了新到的食材，不枉我們當了他兩年熟客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對哦，蘭娜姐，聽妳的描述，我覺得老闆從一開始就很關照我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想像中，他一定矮矮的，脾氣很好，圍裙髒髒的，像胖鐵頭叔叔一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，他是那種，每天拿著菜刀站在門口，就能讓菜市場裡連一根蘿蔔都不會被偷走的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，等你長大了，我就允許你自己上街逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說，上次吃這個，番茄燴瘤獸肉？是什麼時候來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是蘭娜姐和我一起吃的第一頓飯哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是蘭娜姐親自下廚呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，那好像確實是很久遠的事情了。你還記得啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說“做飯只是一件拿手的小事”，結果卻做了一鍋超——級酸的番茄燴瘤獸肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我哪知道那個品種的番茄那麼酸啊。本來還覺得湯汁亮黃亮黃的，看上去那麼鮮美，一定很下飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得蘭娜姐自己嚐過以後，也被酸到臉變形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反、反正能填飽肚子就行了！口味是次要的！你不是照樣都吃光光了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浪費糧食是不對的！而且……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，還是不說以前的事情啦，不然蘭娜姐又要抱怨菜冷了不好吃啦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"小鍋蓋用手輕輕扶著碗，燉菜竟重新冒出了剛出鍋時的熱氣。\n在升騰的白霧中，阿蘭娜的神情變得有點嚴肅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是說好了，不許再這樣隨便使用源石技藝了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提高溫度，這是最快的方法嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是熱一熱菜，稍微用一小下，沒事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你，反正身體是你自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過等到了鋼鐵蘿蔔城，還是要幫你找個可靠的老師，好好學一學怎麼正確地施術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也吃啊，還等什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先看一下嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐吃飯總是吃得很香，看了就會開心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小鍋蓋用布將菜碗邊溢出的湯汁擦乾淨，又擦了擦手。\n她從架子上取了幾本寬大厚重的書，一本本疊在座位上墊高，然後坐了上去。\n小鍋蓋一隻手臂平放在桌台，另一隻手則托著下巴，就這樣瞇著眼，笑著看阿蘭娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到了鋼鐵蘿蔔城，這輛運載車就要還給公司，這條路線也要停運了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不捨得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也沒有啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫米怎麼會有不開心的時候呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，等這條線路停運之後，你還要留在我的車上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等交還公司之後，這輛車大概還會保留，只不過，它不會再經過原本會停留的那些站點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算那樣，我也不會不高興的……嗯，沒錯，我不會不高興的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……要是蘭娜姐還在我身邊，就更沒有什麼不高興的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿蘭娜伸手摸了摸小鍋蓋的頭。作為回應，小鍋蓋動了動耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿嘿……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有、有點癢……"},{"type":"narration","text":"小卡特斯的反應，把阿蘭娜逗笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問總是很厲害還很開心的小鍋蓋，等一下能不能幫我去買點東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？可是溫米已經好久沒有上過街了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前為了更快趕路，我把安全閥拆了，驗車的時候，可不能讓公司發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，現在我們需要一個新的安全閥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一些走長途要用的日用品，工友們本來要幫我們拿一點，但我沒要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……載具廠的叔叔們，知道你要離開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不過我這裡還有一堆事情要收尾，等會兒需要我去親自解決一下，說不好一晚上都忙不完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們知道你要帶著我一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，算是知道吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——所以呢，別的事情就全部交給你囉，反正溫米已經是小大人了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，還有這些——"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿蘭娜將一張紙條塞給小鍋蓋，上面歪歪扭扭地寫著字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把車門口那一堆東西賣掉，應該還能換點錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的，就按照清單上買就可以啦，錢包你拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有最後的工作要去處理一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後了啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們分工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，我們分工！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……然後磐蟹睡醒了，站起來，“咔咔”兩聲，就把塔吊削成好幾段了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"大家一看，鋼筋混凝土砸在它的殼上都砸不出一個坑，那當然是放下手裡小小的鏟子和電焊槍速速逃命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，怎麼樣？聽說這故事是真人，啊不，真蟹真事改編的。我們今晚露天電影就放這個，地點在那邊的礦渣場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不用說感謝的話了。我看你有點陌生，應該是新搬來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我再詳細跟你說說我們這裡打球和玩牌的規矩。每個廠區的規矩都有點不一樣，你知道的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我想買一隻沙地獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……咳，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"籠子裡這幾隻，你隨便挑。我這裡賣的都是訓練好的，能吃能睡，願意跟著人走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不想聊點什麼嗎？比如，今天天氣不錯，對吧？難得有個沒沙塵的好日子，你的工作也好做——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請、請讓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剎、剎不住啊啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰讓這麼小的孩子推這麼多東西，不知道這條街是大斜坡嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……小傢伙，還清醒嗎？有沒有被砸傻的感覺？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒事！我不是小孩子啦，不會有事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，但是我好不容易才把這麼多鍋啊碗啊都疊到一起的，這下都掉地上啦……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩彎腰準備去端起那口大鐵鍋。與此同時，另一隻手也伸了過來。\n兩個人都條件反射地縮手後退了一步，小鍋蓋緊張地拉了拉自己的袖口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……姐姐，這些東西我會自己收拾的，不用幫我撿啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，謝謝你剛才拉住我的推車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。雖然你沒說要停下來，但前面有垃圾回收車，你撞上去，不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？……好吧，你說的也對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起哦，老闆，這些東西堵住你的店門了，我會快快收掉的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，小傢伙，妳慢慢收拾，不用急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等等，原來這裡就是“合金長耳朵”百貨店啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，我想談生意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"談生意？哈哈哈……你家人在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事我不需要她幫忙。她有她的工作，我們分工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼……好吧，你稍微等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你挑好要哪隻沙地獸了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先接待這個小傢伙了。來，你要買什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等哦，我要先賣二手，再買東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆您看，這些鍋碗，還有這個源石瓦斯爐都是要賣的。我打聽過了，保養得這麼好、擦得乾乾淨淨的二手廚具，可以賣不少錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳……連把手都燻黑的鍋，斷了齒的叉子，還有廢鐵皮……你都想賣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賣掉這些的錢，再加上錢包裡的這些硬幣，必須夠買安全閥、電焊鉗、噴漆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這樣吧，你先把你要買的東西拿到櫃檯來，我給你打個折扣，然後按你要買的總價拿你的二手貨，多的我不收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這些東西我必須全賣出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以請你吃一根凍蘿蔔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"那就說定啦。我看看……這個瓦斯爐就夠本了，別的垃圾你自己拿回去，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……小傢伙，你真奇怪，為什麼執著於把所有東西都賣掉？要不是你看起來不像壞人，不然我真的懷疑你是做了什麼事要趕快處理證據了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"而且說實話，我又不認識你，怎麼敢隨便收你推來的雜貨再轉賣給別人？萬一你是感染者呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道一下午肯定賣不出去的！嗯，我都跟她說過了，她還不相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，就這樣回去交差吧，然後再想想辦法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等，小傢伙。是誰叫你來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？是蘭娜姐，荒野上的阿蘭娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，好吧，雖然我不認識你，但那傢伙我還是認識的。她把事情甩給小孩做，反而不奇怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"來，給你個腳凳，我記帳的時候你可以看得清楚一點。回去之後告訴她，東西我先替她收下了，休假的時候抽空請我吃頓飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您怎麼同意啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，我又不是小孩子了，要辦的事情一定能辦成啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，我不願意跟你“談生意”你也不高興，我願意收下這些東西你也不高興啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？沒有，我明明一直都很高興啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……貨架上的安全閥，沒有蘭娜姐說的這種型號啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"這個制式不是早就被淘汰了嗎？自從我們的工會確立規範之後，指導手冊上都不知道建議過幾次別再進這種淘汰貨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我得去別的地方找，一定要找到！老闆，幫我看著推車哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。下次我得跟阿蘭娜好好聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百貨店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，小姐，還沒看好嗎？還是說，你想買點別的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默寡言的顧客","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，真受不了你了，慢吞吞的。扳手給我，我來弄，還是我對自己的車熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是你雇我來做的工作，阿蘭娜，想少付錢就直說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不像你一樣手頭緊巴巴的。我又不酗酒，又不會三天兩頭開車開出故障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，要是我做的工作沒你多，那我豈不是沒辦法跟小鍋蓋吹噓這是我的手藝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，那丫頭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們正在拆的這個，是她睡覺的地方吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，真的啊？！好吧，這次我認輸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都以為你之前只是在嘴硬呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"以你的急躁脾氣，不是早該把她丟給別人照顧了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"——哎，我錯了，別瞪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以我的脾氣？嘖，你覺得我是什麼人？我收留她，本來就是因為你們一個個的都賭我沒耐心照顧小孩，我忍不下這口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再敢小瞧我，下次回來我會把球往你們臉上踢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，主要是這兩年我們都沒再見過她，全憑你一張嘴在說嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"被巨型循獸咬壞履帶，在天災雲底下臨時改接控制閥讓運載車加速，接到被間歇泉拋上車的乘客……你說什麼都說得跟真的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那真的都是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，都是真的。所以你幹嘛一直把她塞在車上，不讓她出來跟我們一起玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"——總不能是因為，她自己還是不願意下車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……那樣的話，明天你這車停運了，她怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……到了鋼鐵蘿蔔城再想辦法囉。公司總不會不給我安排新線路吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"想辦法……等等，你是說，你不打算留在我們鎮子上，而是要去鋼鐵蘿蔔城等新線路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你不準備再回來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，能買到的只有這個了……雖然型號跟蘭娜姐給的有一點點不一樣，但店家說至少能接上去，應該問題不大吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天都快黑了，再不趕快回到車上，我們的事情就做不完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐她……應該也回去了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，小朋友，你好？看你走得比較悠閒，不像是在趕車的樣子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我看起來很悠閒嗎？嘿嘿……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我想耽誤你一點時間，請問一下，你知道從這裡到鋼鐵蘿蔔城的最後一班運載車是幾點發車嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上九點半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有錯的，這條線路我最熟悉啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，嗯，好的，謝謝你，小朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九點半……我還有時間……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，總覺得有點不放心蘭娜姐，怎麼回事呢……"},{"type":"narration","text":"城際運載車發車的關口有一間屬於載具廠的廢棄工坊，窗戶裡正亮著熟悉的燈光。\n小鍋蓋擦了擦窗戶上的灰塵，朝裡面張望——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"narration","text":"出口那條通道，承受著工人們往來進出、堆高機裝貨卸貨帶來的“工作壓力”。\n大家都說，這條路現在又老又滑，像老廠長那洗了二十年的鐵飯盒的底殼。\n在工人們的呼喊聲與口哨聲中，一顆金屬球——準確說是一顆用各種邊角料廢材壓製、磨圓的球，被丟落在平滑的路上。\n球咕咚咕咚地向前方滾去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人“製動器”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好球！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人“發動機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮啊，居然又是一記全倒……不愧是阿蘭娜！好樣的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人“製動器”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算算，十八、十九……足足領先了二十分。這下還怎麼追啊，難對付囉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人“製動器”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！笨手笨腳的小查理，趁現在分數還不算太難看，就此停手吧，可別給我們廠子丟臉啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，你們就閉上嘴在一旁好好看著吧，我會教你們如何投出完美的一球。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"與其擔心我，不如用你們缺乏想像力的生鏽腦袋想一想，今晚的“阿蘭娜歡送會”該如何重新布置……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，名字就先改成“歡迎阿蘭娜正式加入鏽渣子鎮載具廠大家庭的迎新會”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人“發動機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？接下來這一球要是不能一發全倒，恐怕就再也不會有下一球了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他俯身將那些倒下的瓶子扶起、擺正，手蹭了蹭褲子的口袋，能看見汗水在布料上留下了印子。\n拿起球，腳尖抵在發球線上，目視前方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查理，就到此為止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我暫時領先，你也有機會反超我，這樣我們可以“暫緩爭議”——目前的比分，對我們兩個來說，都是可以接受的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這局就算我們各勝一半，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"阿蘭娜，別說在我們這裡了，就算把全雷姆必拓礦業聯合的所有比賽都算上，哪有任何一場，是像你這樣玩的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒記錯的話，原本我們說好的是——如果我贏了，你就留下，要是你贏了，我們就不再留你，任你遠走高飛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你又要強行和局……難道你還能把身體劈成兩半，一半開著你的運載車去鋼鐵蘿蔔城，一半留在我們的載具廠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你準備把一半的時間分給新生活，另一半時間，留給我們這些老朋友們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饒了我吧，我跟那些新上任的廠區代表可不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們早上在大會上宣布最新的發展規劃，下午到礦井裡監督工程，晚上還能出席無聊的應酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我分身乏術，就連開運載車，精力也就剛剛足夠握好手裡的操縱桿，最多再空出一隻耳朵去聽乘客們談論的奇聞軼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我的提議是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先去鋼鐵蘿蔔城把一切都處理妥當，下次回來時，再來跟你們談論加入載具廠的事囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕是就沒打算再回來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？因為你跟我們打的賭？因為那個小丫頭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……小鍋蓋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你你你怎麼在打球？之前不是說……你有很多要親自處理的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，還沒結果的賭局，當然要親自處理啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘆氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）蘭娜姐……真是的，懶瘤獸。"},{"type":"narration","text":"小鍋蓋高高舉起手，用力推了一下阿蘭娜的肩膀。\n滑落的袖口處露出一小片不規則的黑色晶體，阿蘭娜送給她的手鍊也沒能完全遮住晶體反射的光澤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，為什麼你的朋友們都看著我啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘖，他們就是好奇。走，我們回車上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？我敢打賭沒人看得出這裡四個小時之前還有一間違建的廚房，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是全廠區最高超的載具美容手藝，我可是難得這麼認真地大展身手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，真的一點都看不出來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，蘭娜姐你之前沒說要把這些都拆掉啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不過，你真厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前你不是說剩餘的工作會很麻煩很麻煩，可能一晚上都做不完，所以只能把買東西的任務交給我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我跑完一趟回來，你不僅把這些弄完了，還和叔叔們打了球，現在都在喝汽水看雜誌啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，哈哈，那是當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，接下來只有三個小問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，這裡還要用噴漆蓋一下露出來的煙燻痕跡。我演示一下怎麼操作給你看，然後那兩罐噴漆你就可以自己拿去玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不小心把菜燒起火的次數還真多啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後是備用動力爐管道的安全閥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我沒有找到蘭娜姐想要的那種，那是不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我們就沒辦法交車了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我早就猜到市面上可能買不到適合的舊型號啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的運載車要送去檢修升級，就是因為車子的其他部分雖然還算新，但動力爐部分太老舊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前沒人管，但是最近，比格皮勒自治州的幾家工會商量著要“規範化”嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，“規範化”，這個外來詞聽起來很酷吧？你理解成定規矩就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然舊動力爐的這些小毛病都難不倒我，不過工會說換上廣告裡那些先進設備是為了大家好，我覺得也挺有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，正因為之前不符合規矩，明天我們才要去鋼鐵蘿蔔城的運輸公司更新設備，這個安全閥有點不合也不會被罵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只用完成最後一班運輸啦，只要車子能開到目的地就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一需要用到備用管道，那就——得靠你幫忙啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和之前一樣，我叫你下到動力室看看狀況的時候，你要及時報告給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是要交給出發車站的《停運報告書》。這次發車之後，我們就不會再開回來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿蘭娜稍微停頓下，看了小鍋蓋一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈，這麼多手續真麻煩欸，是不是？通知還來得這麼急，我叫“厚手掌帕克”教了我兩個小時才填完表格，今天根本來不及送去車站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你今天做得不錯的份上，明早我就親自去交《報告書》吧，你躲在工具間裡好好睡個懶覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實你心裡難過的話，可以偶爾表現出來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……要是路線改變了，蘭娜姐以後就很難見到這邊的一些好朋友了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，明天我去交《報告書》吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，你可以再跟朋友們好好地聊聊天，也就不會為分開而難過了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我沒有廚房，等到了新家，搭好了小屋子，我立刻做妳每次吃了都會開心的甜肉湯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃！你又拍我背！力氣太大啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是會長大嘛，長著長著就習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，接好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上，允許你跟我一起喝冰汽水，比平常晚一個小時睡覺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——好睏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我是不會走錯路的！我又不是小孩子，絕不會看不懂地圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，這裡轉彎，前面上樓……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……咦，昨天那個人還坐在那裡啊，難道他沒趕上車嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅坐的位置沒變，好像連姿勢和憂鬱的表情都沒變。哇，真厲害……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是你，小朋友……早、早安……你來得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，今天去鋼鐵蘿蔔城最早的一班運載車，是幾點發車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是六點二十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是那趟車上的──"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，我、我也要搭那趟車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來剛好能趕上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以帶你去，這樣你就絕對不會錯過了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不不不用了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起，我、我還是很感謝你的……但，呃，我想在這裡再坐一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……難道，您在等人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？沒有，我……呃，為什麼你會這麼想？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的叔叔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，溫米，今晚先回大棚屋，不要再等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的叔叔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種事難免會發生的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在等人是很正常的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我要走了，拜拜！祝你等到想見的人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那個，我怕都要怕死了，根本不想見……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏畏縮縮的乘客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，卡特斯小孩跑得真快……還是，呃，謝謝她吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下一位，請帶好資料進入辦公室。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（踮起腳）辦公室的門到底還有多遠啊，站在隊伍裡根本看不見……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，車快要開了，文件好像來不及交了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大清早居然這麼多人，這就是運氣不好吧。就算是大人，遇到運氣不好的時候也沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，是啊，人太多了。工會想要讓活動顯得正規一點是挺好的，但他們也不用把健美比賽的申請跟政務放在一張桌子上處理吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這跟以前一大家子人排著隊去奶奶的房間告狀的做法還是一模一樣啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好這邊是我來辦事，要是換成博士和阿米婭那兩個大忙人來，可就要頭痛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，阿米婭，阿米婭……她才十幾歲啊，究竟是誰讓她背上了那麼重的擔子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，小妹妹，你剛剛說你趕時間是嗎？你這麼小，還這麼瘦弱，應該不是來報名參加健美比賽的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不，不是，我是來提交《停運報告書》的。你看，就是這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果今天來不及交，這趟車應該就不能停運，對吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，這個好說，交給我就行啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，要停運的是我們的車啊……你難道認識蘭娜姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你難道是駕駛員本人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，這就對啦，這說明《停運報告書》只要交上去就好，誰轉交都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我也要在這裡排隊，幫你把材料交到那張辦公桌上只是舉手之勞而已，你就放心地回去趕車吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哎呀，你怎麼悶悶不樂的樣子，還有什麼擔心的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，有嗎……不行不行，我不能這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……給你，《報告書》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你啦，好心的大姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這孩子的健康狀況……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……小妹妹，這個給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……小卡片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷厲風行的女性","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"名片。記得交給你家人，也許你們有朝一日會用得上的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快上車！再過一下子乘客們就都上來啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼……來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這趟旅途你就委屈一下，躲在工具間裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題的，我記得，一開始我在這裡住了好久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，你還是可以用這個小終端看到載具內部的監控畫面，看到每一個上車的人……也不用我多說了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我去駕駛室了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼短的時間裡，溫米完成了很多事情啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明有那麼多困難，就連蘭娜姐自己也說時間可能來不及……但最後還是把車收拾成能交付的樣子啦，手續也都辦好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個一直坐在車站的人，終於趕上車了啊，太好啦……對，我還幫助了一個搞不清車次的人呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"運載車全域廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"運載車入口已關閉，車輛即將啟動，請各位乘客迅速找好座位，或在適當的空間固定好自己的折疊躺椅、小板凳、地舖捲……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我表現得這麼好，應該開開心心的，還可以小小地驕傲一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我真的很希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事情都好，要是能延遲這趟車被停掉的時間就好了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我還沒有等到……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"運載車全域廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這輛運載車已被徵用，現在即將開往咧嘴谷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小鍋蓋看向了播放著駕駛室監控畫面的螢幕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從廣播中傳出的陌生聲音來自她昨天遇見過的古怪女性。阿蘭娜平常所用的廣播麥克風正被那位女性抓在手裡。\n而她的另一隻手臂穩穩地端著自己的無翼弩，弩箭抵在阿蘭娜的頸側。\n或許是察覺到了監控器轉換角度的細小動靜，她透過鏡頭，無比平靜地向小鍋蓋望了一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"運載車全域廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"包括駕駛員在內，不需要前往咧嘴谷的乘客，現在可以下車。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小鍋蓋","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………欸？真的是劫車？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
